; 最后结尾的账户要一眼能看出来是干什么的

; ==============;
; Equity（平衡）;
; ==============;
1990-01-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances                               ;初始平衡账户：负责初始化

1990-01-01 open Equity:BadDebts                                       ;坏账：对账时可能之差一块钱，实在是不想找了，我一般就会放在这个账户里
  account-type: "bad-debt"

1990-01-01 open Equity:Exchange                                       ;大额转账，不破坏查询图表展示

; ==============;
; Income（入账）;
; ==============;

1990-01-01 open Income:Salary                                         ;工资

1990-01-01 open Income:Investment                                     ;投资收益/亏损

1990-01-01 open Income:Interest                                       ;利息：这里可以放一些例如银行的结息等有关利息的条目

1990-01-01 open Income:Sale                                           ;销售：这里单独指一些例如出二手，或者卖货之类的条目

1990-01-01 open Income:Other                                          ;其他

; ===================;
; Liabilities（负债）;
; ===================;

; 消费信贷
1990-01-01 open Liabilities:ConsumptionCredit
  account-type: "consumer-credit"

1990-01-01 open Liabilities:ConsumptionCredit:花呗

1990-01-01 open Liabilities:ConsumptionCredit:白条

1990-01-01 open Liabilities:ConsumptionCredit:抖音月付

1990-01-01 open Liabilities:ConsumptionCredit:美团月付

; 信用卡
1990-01-01 open Liabilities:CreditCard
  account-type: "credit-card"

1990-01-01 open Liabilities:CreditCard:CMB-1111                      CNY

1990-01-01 open Liabilities:CreditCard:CMB-1222                      CNY,USD

; 向朋友借款
1970-01-01 open Liabilities:Personal                                 CNY
  account-type: "personal-loan"

; ==============;
; Assets（资产）;
; ==============;

; 借记卡
2017-01-01 open Assets:DebitCard
  account-type: "cash"
  fire: "true"

2017-01-01 open Assets:DebitCard:CMB-1222                            CNY

2017-01-01 open Assets:DebitCard:CMB-1333                            CNY

; 电子支付账户
2017-01-01 open Assets:Digital
  fire: "true"
  account-type: "operating-cash"

2017-01-01 open Assets:Digital:AliPay                                CNY

2017-01-01 open Assets:Digital:WeChatPay                             CNY

; ================;
; Expenses（消费）;
; ================;

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Insurance                                    ; 保险：所有有关保险的放到这里

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Tax                                          ; 税费：个人所得税、五险，五险在我眼里也算税的一种，毕竟也是归税务局管。

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Fees                                         ; 服务费：各种服务费

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Other                                        ; 其他：兜底用的

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Software                                     ; 软件：云会员、云服务器、对象存储,域名注册和续费、IDE、工具软件授权、话费

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Entertainment                                ; 娱乐：去游乐场、看电影、买玩具

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Electronics                                  ; 电子产品和其他

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Gifts-to-SB                                  ; 给别人

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Shopping                                     ;任何无法分类的购物

; 个人
1990-01-01 open Expenses:Personal:个人护理                            ;理发、美妆、美容

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Personal:健身

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Personal:教育                                ; 学习：书籍、考试课程、认证、学费

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Personal:服饰和鞋

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Personal:生活日用品

