1990-01-01 open Expenses:Food:米面油料水

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Food:生鲜蛋奶

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Food:水果蔬菜

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Food:饮料零食

1990-01-01 open Expenses:Food:快餐外卖


